arding the multiplicities of the roots of a polynomial from its graph.\n\n- If the graph intersects the $x$-axis but is *not* tangent to the $x$-axis at $x=a,$ we have a *simple* root $x=a.$\n\n- If the graph is *tangent* to the $x$-axis at $x=a,$ we have a *multiple* root $x=a.$ Furthermore:\n\n- If the graph touches the $x$-axis and reverses direction at $x=a,$ the multiplicity of a root $x=a$ is *even*.\n\n- If the graph crosses the $x$-axis at $x=a,$ the multiplicity of a root $x=a$ is *odd*.\n\nIn our case, the graph is *not* tangent to the $x$-axis at $x=4.$ Therefore, $x=4$ is a *simple* root."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186566199 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129253 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4d48e2a0-1a76-5eec-a98c-4a7eb16f70cb" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Multiplicity of a Root Given a Graph"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4e630767-5cfc-5240-86dc-1f0035f469b2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=-7$ is a simple root" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186565801} {:answer/id #uuid "69f96cf3-ab2c-51fc-9b3c-ef729116e639" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=-7$ is a multiple root of even multiplicity" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186565843} {:answer/id #uuid "ee6a1dc3-31ce-59a1-b68d-705ad5178538" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=-7$ is a simple root of even multiplicity" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186566068} {:answer/id #uuid "fb64727d-54cb-5ca3-9501-af15e869cd65" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=-7$ is not a root of $p(x)$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186566093} {:answer/id #uuid "fffa4889-a79d-5ffe-a1c5-5d4b141384c5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=-7$ is a multiple root of odd multiplicity" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186566099}] :answer-field/co